        <mxCell id="rules" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;rounded=0;spacing=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Design rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Self-declared checklist: no document numbers or uploads (declared_status).&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Requirement Rule is deterministic; null FK = applies to any.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Mandatory level lives only in Requirement Rule; the rule and version used are stored on the checklist item, so scores are reproducible.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; QR Summary holds a signed token + expiry, no personal data.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Inbound travellers to Uganda only (no direction field)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="300" x="760" y="40" as="geometry" />
